OL,3,GNEWSACouple campaigns to save their
OL,4,Awedding venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple are campaigning to save the
OL,7,Fhotel where they got married after the
OL,8,Fbuilding has been derelict for four
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FTess and Des Shephard celebrated their
OL,12,Fwedding at the Riviera Hotel in
OL,13,FWeymouth in 2018 before the building
OL,14,Fwent on to close in 2022 following
OL,15,Fstorm damage.
OL,17,FTess, who is behind the Revive the
OL,18,FRiviera campaign to get new ownership
OL,19,Fat the hotel said it was "a lovely
OL,20,Fbuilding" and she was just seeing what
OL,21,Fshe could do to help.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
